# Disposable Metalium runtime telemetry and duplicate launcher output.
# Keep proof logs, raw model replies, execution logs, outputs and device ELFs:
# these are experiment evidence checked by the artifact audits.
/benchmarks/tenstorrent/protocol/*/runtime/**/generated/
/benchmarks/tenstorrent/protocol/*/runtime/**/driver.log
/benchmarks/tenstorrent/protocol/*/runtime/**/extra-driver.log
